   "id": "lead-1",
   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "HaMaas (, HaMa'as, ) was a weekly publication of the Lehi, an armed Zionist militant group and self-described terrorist organization in Mandatory Palestine.",
   "words": 23,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1",
    "Editor 3",
    "Editor 2",
    "Editor 5",
