   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "lead-2",
   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "Other publications by the Lehi included the daily Mivrak ('Telegram'), the monthly HaKhazit ('the Front'), and BaMahteret ('Underground').",
   "words": 18,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 2",
    "Editor 4"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    13,
    5
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 620615609,
   "revisions": [
    620615609,
    1226517739,
    620615668
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    10,
    5,
    3
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-1",
   "section": "History",
   "text": "The publication first came to public attention in July 1946 after the report of the Anglo-American Committee of Inquiry and a British Colonial Office White Paper identified an article in the second issue indicating that a Lehi attack on the Haifa Oil Refinery on the night of 31 October/1 November 1945 had been coordinated with other attacks on the same night by the Haganah (on railways), the Irgun (on Lydda railway station) and the Palmach (on two British coast guard vessels in Haifa harbour) under the overall direction of the Jewish Agency.",
   "words": 94,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    94
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 367401790,
   "revisions": [
    367401790
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    94
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-2",
   "section": "History",
   "text": "Hamaas noted,",
   "words": 2,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    2
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 367401790,
   "revisions": [
    367401790
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    2
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-3",
   "section": "History",
   "text": "The events of 1 November have given a striking expression of the firm resolution of the Jews to fight for the freedom of their homeland.",
   "words": 25,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    25
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 367401790,
   "revisions": [
    367401790
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    25
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-4",
   "section": "History",
   "text": "The scope of the attack has proved that the Jews are capable of acting under the most difficult conditions.",
   "words": 19,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    19
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 367401790,
   "revisions": [
    367401790
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    19
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-5",
   "section": "History",
   "text": "However the most significant achievement on that night was that for the first time the attack was coordinated and concentrated.",
   "words": 20,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    20
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 367401790,
   "revisions": [
    367401790
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    20
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-6",
   "section": "History",
   "text": "The Jewish Resistance Movement has embraced all the Jewish resistance forces with a view to their being guided by a single authority which would control the common fight.",
   "words": 28,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    28
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 367401790,
   "revisions": [
    367401790
   ],
   "revision_words": [
